{"id": "d5_if_0001", "dim": "D5", "source": "ifeval-style", "subcat": "verifiable", "user": "写一段介绍杭州龙井茶的文字。要求：1. 恰好 3 句话 2. 必须包含「狮峰」 3. 不得出现「最好」 4. 最后一句以问号结尾", "expect": {"checkers": [{"type": "sentence_count", "value": 3}, {"type": "contains", "value": "狮峰"}, {"type": "not_contains", "value": "最好"}, {"type": "last_sentence_ends_with", "value": "？"}]}, "notes": "四重可验证约束"}
{"id": "d5_format_0001", "dim": "D5", "source": "ifeval-style", "subcat": "format", "user": "输出一个 JSON 对象，包含：name（字符串）、tags（恰好 3 个字符串的数组）、score（0-100 整数）。不要输出其他任何内容，不要用代码块包裹。", "expect": {"checkers": [{"type": "json_valid"}, {"type": "field", "name": "name", "type": "string"}, {"type": "array_len", "path": "tags", "value": 3}, {"type": "field", "name": "score", "type": "int", "range": [0, 100]}]}, "notes": "严格格式约束"}
{"id": "d5_style_0001", "dim": "D5", "source": "selfmade", "subcat": "style", "user": "用「正式公文」语气写一份 50-80 字的会议通知。必须包含：时间、地点、议题。不得使用感叹号，不得使用口语词。", "expect": {"checkers": [{"type": "length_range", "min": 50, "max": 80}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["时间", "地点", "议题"]}, {"type": "not_contains", "value": "！"}, {"type": "style_keyword", "values": ["兹定于", "特此通知", "请"]}]}, "notes": "语气+长度+禁词三约束"}
